From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000009 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TB371FC Linux Project <tb371fc-linux@localhost>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 19:10:00 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] drm/panel: tb371fc: log packed DSC PPS once

Print the exact 128-byte payload used for the first native-display test.  It
lets the serial/USB log prove whether mainline generated the same DSC geometry
as the known-good Lenovo payload even when the panel cannot decode the frame.
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
index b75fca2be54e..d3021462c9ff 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/panel-novatek-nt36523.c
@@ -594,6 +594,10 @@ static int tb371fc_nt36532_init_sequence(struct panel_info *pinfo, bool boe)
 	mipi_dsi_dual_dcs_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, dsi0, dsi1, 0x53, 0x2c);
 	mipi_dsi_dual_dcs_write_seq_multi(&dsi_ctx, dsi0, dsi1, 0x55, 0x01);
 	drm_dsc_pps_payload_pack(&pps, &pinfo->dsc);
+	print_hex_dump(KERN_INFO, "TB371FC mainline DSC PPS: ",
+		       DUMP_PREFIX_OFFSET, 16, 1, &pps, sizeof(pps), false);
+
 	mipi_dsi_dual(mipi_dsi_picture_parameter_set_multi, &dsi_ctx,
 		      dsi0, dsi1, &pps);
 
